        "offering_role": "service",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "Additionally, we offer managed services, managed security services and payment transactions fraud monitoring to all the regions where we do business.",
        "start_character": 2790,
        "end_character": 2939
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001559865-26-000012",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001559865-26-000012-d121a2d98c18d5ca",
        "accession_number": "0001559865-26-000012",
        "filing_date": "2026-03-02",
        "offering_role": "service",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "Additionally, we provide a number of critical payment services, core banking services, managed services and managed security services to Popular as part of the A&R MSA through September 2028 and benefit from the bank’s distribution network and continued support.",
        "start_character": 13762,
        "end_character": 14024
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001559865-26-000012",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001559865-26-000012-d121a2d98c18d5ca",
        "accession_number": "0001559865-26-000012",
        "filing_date": "2026-03-02",
        "offering_role": "operator_business",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "As a data processing company that services both foreign and domestic clients, our business activities in foreign countries, and in particular our transactions with foreign governmental entities, subject us to the anti-bribery provisions of the FCPA, as well as the laws and regulations of the foreign jurisdiction where we operate.",
        "start_character": 50345,
        "end_character": 50676
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001559865-26-000012",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001559865-26-000012-d121a2d98c18d5ca",
        "accession_number": "0001559865-26-000012",
        "filing_date": "2026-03-02",
        "offering_role": "service",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "As a provider of services to financial institutions, we are required to comply with applicable privacy and cybersecurity regulations and are bound by the same limitations on disclosure of the information received from our customers as applied to the financial institutions themselves.",
        "start_character": 44627,
        "end_character": 44911
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001559865-26-000012",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001559865-26-000012-d121a2d98c18d5ca",
        "accession_number": "0001559865-26-000012",
        "filing_date": "2026-03-02",
        "offering_role": "operator_business",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "As a technology service provider to financial institutions, we are also subject to regulatory oversight and examination by the Federal Financial Institutions Examination Council (the “FFIEC”), an interagency body of federal financial regulators that includes the Board of Governors of the Federal Reserve System (known as the Federal Reserve Board).",
        "start_character": 37609,
        "end_character": 37958
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001559865-26-000012",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001559865-26-000012-d121a2d98c18d5ca",
        "accession_number": "0001559865-26-000012",
        "filing_date": "2026-03-02",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "At the point-of-sale, we sell transaction-processing technology solutions, similar to the services in our merchant acquiring business, to other merchant acquirers enabling them to service their own merchant customers.",
        "start_character": 21502,
        "end_character": 21719
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001559865-26-000012",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001559865-26-000012-d121a2d98c18d5ca",
        "accession_number": "0001559865-26-000012",
        "filing_date": "2026-03-02",
        "offering_role": "service",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "Further, we also use a combination of (i) proprietary software, and (ii) duly licensed third-party software to operate our business and deliver secure and reliable products and services to our customers.",
        "start_character": 29906,
        "end_character": 30109
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001559865-26-000012",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001559865-26-000012-d121a2d98c18d5ca",
        "accession_number": "0001559865-26-000012",
        "filing_date": "2026-03-02",
        "offering_role": "operator_business",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "Furthermore, as a data processing company that provides services to foreign parties and facilitates financial transactions between foreign parties, we are obligated to screen transactions for compliance with the sanctions programs administered by the U.S.",
        "start_character": 45754,
        "end_character": 46009
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001559865-26-000012",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001559865-26-000012-d121a2d98c18d5ca",
        "accession_number": "0001559865-26-000012",
        "filing_date": "2026-03-02",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "Furthermore, we believe we are well positioned to develop new products and services and take advantage of our access and position in markets we currently serve.",
        "start_character": 16938,
        "end_character": 17098
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001559865-26-000012",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001559865-26-000012-d121a2d98c18d5ca",
        "accession_number": "0001559865-26-000012",
        "filing_date": "2026-03-02",
        "offering_role": "operator_business",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "In addition, there are other laws, rules and/or regulations, including the Telemarketing Sales Act, that may directly impact the activities of our merchant customers and in some cases may subject us, as the merchant’s payment processor, to investigations, fees, fines, and disgorgement of funds in the event we are deemed to have aided and abetted or otherwise provided the means and instrumentalities to facilitate the illegal activities of the merchant through our payment processing services.",
        "start_character": 48141,
        "end_character": 48636
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001559865-26-000012",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001559865-26-000012-d121a2d98c18d5ca",
        "accession_number": "0001559865-26-000012",
        "filing_date": "2026-03-02",
        "offering_role": "service",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "In addition, we believe that scale and financial institution industry expertise, combined with our ability to offer multiple applications, services and integrated solutions to individual customers, enhances our competitiveness against companies with more limited offerings and helps us compete with large global competitors with similar assets to ours.",
        "start_character": 26490,
        "end_character": 26842
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001559865-26-000012",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001559865-26-000012-d121a2d98c18d5ca",
        "accession_number": "0001559865-26-000012",
        "filing_date": "2026-03-02",
        "offering_role": "service",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "In addition, we believe the recurring nature of our business model provides us with revenue and earnings stability.",
        "start_character": 14200,
        "end_character": 14315
      }
    ]
